{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/6d6f4c6ce59956661558d792cf00b99d.poster.avif?t=1754583589\" width=616 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/6d6f4c6ce59956661558d792cf00b99d.webm?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/6d6f4c6ce59956661558d792cf00b99d.mp4?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the A.I.L.A Demo as Samuel, a games tester. Survive, solve puzzles and explore the eerie Impossible House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEAR</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/8fe60ab6a777b2d4328632d994477f4a.poster.avif?t=1754583589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/8fe60ab6a777b2d4328632d994477f4a.webm?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/8fe60ab6a777b2d4328632d994477f4a.mp4?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a game tester, share your thoughts, fears and feedback with A.I.L.A as she crafts haunting new experiences for you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPOSSIBLE HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/60267587c6dfde2ca631737ad891863a.poster.avif?t=1754583589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/60267587c6dfde2ca631737ad891863a.webm?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/60267587c6dfde2ca631737ad891863a.mp4?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the intense horror of the Impossible House, hand-crafted by A.I.L.A that preys on your deepest fears...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NEXT-GENERATION OF HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/3294f99c531a55e2e4af1d2609e498ef.poster.avif?t=1754583589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/3294f99c531a55e2e4af1d2609e498ef.webm?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/3294f99c531a55e2e4af1d2609e498ef.mp4?t=1754583589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5 and using advanced graphical technologies such as Lumen and MetaHuman, A.I.L.A is an immersive, photorealistic experience that takes the player to the edge of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804480/extras/170362574f8204ba10a1b6ca4e7f8664.poster.avif?t=1754583589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://